<BaseLayout title="About" description="Why Mossy Tank exists and who's behind the guides.">
  <div class="container prose post">
    <h1>About Mossy Tank</h1>
    <p>
      Mossy Tank is here for one kind of person: someone who wants a lush, living planted aquarium
      but feels overwhelmed by CO2 systems, dosing schedules, and contradictory advice. We believe
      a beautiful tank shouldn't require a chemistry degree.
    </p>
    <p>
      Everything here is written from hands-on, low-tech experience — real tanks, real mistakes, and
      the simple setups that actually work for beginners. No hype, no killed fish, no jargon.
    </p>

    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Beginner-first explanations, in plain English.</li>
      <li>Gear recommendations we'd actually use — and honest notes on what to skip.</li>
      <li>Methods that keep livestock healthy and tanks low-maintenance.</li>
    </ul>

